OL,3,GNEWSAWhy 18th Century stately home
OL,4,Acelebrates Diwali
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stately home built in the 18th
OL,7,Fcentury is opening its doors again to
OL,8,Fcelebrate Diwali.
OL,10,FKedleston Hall near Derby may not be
OL,11,Fthe most obvious choice to host the
OL,12,Ffestivities - but its museum contains
OL,13,Fmore than 1,000 items from India and
OL,14,Fneighbouring South Asian countries.
OL,16,FThe neo-classical home and its links to
OL,17,Fthe region are down to one of its
OL,18,Fformer occupants - Lord Curzon - a
OL,19,Fformer Viceroy of India during British
OL,20,Fcolonial rule.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
