OL,3,GNEWSAWhy 18th Century stately home
OL,4,Acelebrates Diwali
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorgan Feely, property curator at
OL,7,FKedleston Hall, run by the National
OL,8,FTrust, said the Diwali events provide
OL,9,Fan opportunity to explore the
OL,10,Fproperty's own historical connections
OL,11,Fwith Asia.
